{"t_ms": 817984, "conversation_id": "v2llm_streaming_retrieve_s035", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["# corpus/ \u2014 Hotel Documents\n\n**Owner: Lakshya**\n\n## What this folder is\n\nThe hotel's documents live here: the knowledge the assistant answers from. About 60 short \ndocuments covering things like pool and gym hours, check-in and check-out rules, menus, and \npolicies.\n\n## How to fill it\n\nSee the full instructions in `retrieval/README.md` (Step 1). In short:\n- Write ~60 short documents, one topic per file, as `.txt` or `.md`.\n- Make them realistic and varied.\n- Deliberately plant a few contradictions (e.g. one doc says the pool closes at 10 PM, \n  another says 9 PM) and keep a note of which ones, for a later experiment.\n\nThe index-building script reads every file in this folder, so anything you put here becomes \npart of the searchable knowledge.\n", "Foreign Currency Exchange Service\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nLimited foreign currency exchange services are available for registered hotel guests during reception operating hours. Exchange rates are based on the prevailing daily market rate and may vary. Guests are required to present valid identification while requesting this service. Major international currencies are accepted, subject to availability.", "Taxi & Local Transport Booking\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Concierge Desk can arrange taxis, airport transfers, car rentals, and local sightseeing transportation. Guests are encouraged to book transportation in advance during weekends and holidays. Fare estimates will be provided before confirming the reservation, and payment can be made directly to the service provider or added to the room bill where applicable."], "scores": [0.8480800986289978, 1.0697537660598755, 1.122877597808838], "filenames": ["README.md", "10_currency_exchange.txt", "49_taxi_booking.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 97, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
